OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy start and the odd spot
OL,6,Fof light drizzle can't be ruled out.
OL,7,FOtherwise it will be a dry day with
OL,8,Fincreasing bright or sunny spells
OL,9,Fdeveloping later.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FIt will stay dry with
OL,12,Fvariable cloud and clear spells. Areas
OL,13,Fof fog are likely to form under clear
OL,14,Fskies, with a touch of rural frost in
OL,15,Fplaces as well.
OL,16,
OL,17,CMonday:FA chilly start with fog in
OL,18,Fplaces which may be slow to clear.
OL,19,FOtherwise dry with variable cloud and
OL,20,Fincreasing bright or sunny spells.
OL,21,FFrost and fog possible again overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
